  "content": {
    "text": "Tech Stocks\nIntel’s stock soars as the company’s ‘blue-chip roster’ of customers looks to be growing\nInvestors are cheering the idea that Intel could serve as a backup chip manufacturer for Nvidia and Google\nIntel has been racking up deals in the Big Tech universe, and the company may be adding two more high-profile customers to its roster.\nShares of Intel INTC soared 11% on Monday after The Information released a report saying that Google GOOGL GOOG and Nvidia NVDA are considering Intel as a backup chip provider. According to the report, Alphabet could have Intel manufacture over 3 million tensor processing units starting in 2028.",
    "text_blocks": [
      "Tech Stocks",
      "Intel’s stock soars as the company’s ‘blue-chip roster’ of customers looks to be growing",
      "Investors are cheering the idea that Intel could serve as a backup chip manufacturer for Nvidia and Google",
      "Intel has been racking up deals in the Big Tech universe, and the company may be adding two more high-profile customers to its roster.",
      "Shares of Intel INTC soared 11% on Monday after The Information released a report saying that Google GOOGL GOOG and Nvidia NVDA are considering Intel as a backup chip provider. According to the report, Alphabet could have Intel manufacture over 3 million tensor processing units starting in 2028."
